# Written by `uconsole usb-direct generate` (WP AUSB3): installation "cinema", unit front (Front L/C/R and sub).
# Run it on this unit only:
#   uconsole --device E6614C311B4A8B2F -f front.dspi
# then save the unit's preset (Ctrl-S in the interface, or preset.save <slot>).
# Mode, D and the lock-error action are not here: the hub writes them (SETTINGS.md).
in.source usb
# output 0: FL (USB input 0)
mix 0 0 on 0
mix 1 0 off
mix 2 0 off
mix 3 0 off
mix 4 0 off
mix 5 0 off
mix 6 0 off
mix 7 0 off
# output 1: FR (USB input 1)
mix 0 1 off
mix 1 1 on 0
mix 2 1 off
mix 3 1 off
mix 4 1 off
mix 5 1 off
mix 6 1 off
mix 7 1 off
# output 2: FC (USB input 2)
mix 0 2 off
mix 1 2 off
mix 2 2 on 0
mix 3 2 off
mix 4 2 off
mix 5 2 off
mix 6 2 off
mix 7 2 off
# output 8: LFE (USB input 3)
mix 0 8 off
mix 1 8 off
mix 2 8 off
mix 3 8 on 0
mix 4 8 off
mix 5 8 off
mix 6 8 off
mix 7 8 off
